# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.development.local`) for `pnpm dev` — the real file
# is gitignored (`docs/24` §1). These three, plus a local Supabase started
# with `supabase start`, are what let the dev-auth bypass in `src/lib/devAuth.ts`
# evaluate true (`docs/24` §2 — all three flags AND a localhost Supabase URL).
EXPO_PUBLIC_ENV=development
EXPO_PUBLIC_SKIP_AUTH=1
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=http://localhost:54321
EXPO_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=replace-with-local-supabase-anon-key
